  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CPNCK Coffee Laboratory</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Coffee.Beneficiaries: 2135 (420 women).Description: The project will provide the cooperative withpurchase funds/working capital for raw material purchases to ensure adequate supply of cherries for processing, and the installation of a modern coffee &quot;laboratory&quot; for roasting and cupping to promote improvements to overall coffee quality, marketing abilities, and operational sophistication. The group will also acquire fair trade/organic certifications that will also increase revenues.</narrative>
  </description>
